A condition is true (all events), false (no events), or an object with exactly one key:
- tag: name — an exact, case-sensitive personal tag match;
- not: condition — negation;
- and: [conditions] — all must match; an empty list means true;
- or: [conditions] — at least one must match; an empty list means false.
Conditions can be nested. Example: {and: [{tag: work}, {not: {tag: vacation}}]}.
